@Financial.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5213

### Get all accounts
GET {{Financial.Api_HostAddress}}/api/accounts
Accept: application/json

###

### Get all categories
GET {{Financial.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

###

### Get all transactions
GET {{Financial.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transactions
Accept: application/json

###

### Create account
POST {{Financial.Api_HostAddress}}/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ueno Bank",
  "type": "BankAccount",
  "currency": "PYG",
  "accountNumber": "xxxx2039432",
  "institution": "Ueno Bank",
  "currentBalance": 1000000,
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Create category
POST {{Financial.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Professional Service",
  "description": "Software and professional services",
  "type": "Expense",
  "color": "#4CAF50",
  "icon": "code"
}

###

### Create transaction
POST {{Financial.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "categoryId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "date": "2026-08-11",
  "amount": -62000,
  "currency": "PYG",
  "merchant": "Github Copilot",
  "description": "Monthly subscription",
  "type": "Expense"
}

###

### Preview import - NOTE: This requires multipart/form-data
### Use Postman, Insomnia, or curl for file uploads
### Example curl command:
### curl -X POST http://localhost:5213/api/import/preview -F "file=@sample-transactions.csv"

POST {{Financial.Api_HostAddress}}/api/import/preview
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample-transactions.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

Date,Amount,Currency,Merchant,Category,Account,Notes
2026-07-01,-62000,PYG,Github Copilot,Professional Service,Mastercard Credit Card Ueno,
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

### Execute import
POST {{Financial.Api_HostAddress}}/api/import/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "batchId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "skipDuplicates": true,
  "autoCreateCategories": true,
  "autoCreateAccounts": false
}

###

### Validate import file
POST {{Financial.Api_HostAddress}}/api/import/validate
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample-transactions.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

Date,Amount,Currency,Merchant,Category,Account,Notes
2026-07-01,-62000,PYG,Github Copilot,Professional Service,Mastercard Credit Card Ueno,
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###
